  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/scholarlydata/inproceedings/iswc2016/paper/posterdemo/demo-48">
    <j.13:maker rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/jedrzej-potoniec"/>
    <j.9:authorList rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/scholarlydata/inproceedings/iswc2016/paper/posterdemo/demo-48/authorList"/>
    <j.3:keyword rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">protege plugin</j.3:keyword>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#Object"/>
    <dc:subject rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">linked data mining</dc:subject>
    <dc:creator rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/jedrzej-potoniec"/>
    <j.3:hasAuthorList rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/scholarlydata/inproceedings/iswc2016/paper/posterdemo/demo-48/authorList"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#SocialObject"/>
    <j.3:abstract>We present a Protege plugin implementing Swift Linked Data Miner, an anytime algorithm for extending an ontology with new subsumptions. The algorithm mines an RDF graph accessible via a SPARQL endpoint and proposes new SubClassOf axioms to the user.</j.3:abstract>
    <j.2:abstract>We present a Protege plugin implementing Swift Linked Data Miner, an anytime algorithm for extending an ontology with new subsumptions. The algorithm mines an RDF graph accessible via a SPARQL endpoint and proposes new SubClassOf axioms to the user.</j.2:abstract>
    <dc:subject rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">swift linked data miner</dc:subject>
    <rdfs:label>A Protege Plugin with Swift Linked Data Miner</rdfs:label>
