    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#InformationObject"/>
    <j.3:abstract>In this poster paper we provide an overview of the OpenCitations project and of its main outcome, the OpenCitations Corpus, which is an open repository of scholarly citation data made available under a Creative Commons public domain dedication, which provides in RDF accurate citation information harvested from the scholarly literature.</j.3:abstract>
