  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/scholarlydata/inproceedings/iswc2016/paper/posterdemo/poster-10">
    <dc:creator rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/mikako-saito"/>
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://data.semanticweb.org/conference/iswc/2016/paper/posterdemo/poster-10"/>
    <j.13:maker rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/mikako-saito"/>
    <dc:creator rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/hiroshi-masuya"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"/>
    <j.13:maker rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/eiki-takayama"/>
    <dc:creator rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/sadahiro-kumagai"/>
    <dc:creator rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/kai-lenz"/>
    <j.13:maker rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/terue-takatsuki"/>
    <j.13:maker rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/hiroshi-masuya"/>
    <dc:creator rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/terue-takatsuki"/>
    <j.3:keyword rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">data integration</j.3:keyword>
    <j.3:title>A RDF based Portal of Biological Phenotype Data produced in Japan</j.3:title>
    <dc:creator rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/kazuya-ohshima"/>
    <j.3:keyword rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Biological phenotype</j.3:keyword>
    <j.3:abstract>We developed RDF-based databases of phenotype and animal strains produced in Japan and a portal site termed as “J-Phenome”. By the application of common schema, these databases can be retrieved by the same SPARQL query across graphs. In the operation of these databases, RDF represented multiple advantages such as improvement of comprehensive search, data integration using ontologies and public data, reuse of data and wider dissemination of phenotype data compared to conventional technologies.</j.3:abstract>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/ontology/conference-ontology.owl#InProceedings"/>
    <dc:creator rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/nobuhiko-tanaka"/>
    <dc:creator rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/norio-kobayashi"/>
    <j.3:hasAuthorList rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/scholarlydata/inproceedings/iswc2016/paper/posterdemo/poster-10/authorList"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.org/spar/fabio/ProceedingsPaper"/>
    <j.3:isPartOf rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/conference/iswc/2016/proceedings"/>
    <dc:subject rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">RDF</dc:subject>
    <j.3:keyword rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">RDF</j.3:keyword>
    <j.13:maker rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/norio-kobayashi"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <j.13:maker rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/kazuya-ohshima"/>
    <j.13:maker rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/nobuhiko-tanaka"/>
    <dc:subject rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Biological phenotype</dc:subject>
    <j.9:authorList rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/scholarlydata/inproceedings/iswc2016/paper/posterdemo/poster-10/authorList"/>
    <j.13:maker rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/kai-lenz"/>
    <j.13:maker rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/sadahiro-kumagai"/>
    <j.2:abstract>We developed RDF-based databases of phenotype and animal strains produced in Japan and a portal site termed as “J-Phenome”. By the application of common schema, these databases can be retrieved by the same SPARQL query across graphs. In the operation of these databases, RDF represented multiple advantages such as improvement of comprehensive search, data integration using ontologies and public data, reuse of data and wider dissemination of phenotype data compared to conventional technologies.</j.2:abstract>
    <dc:subject rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">data integration</dc:subject>
    <rdfs:label>A RDF based Portal of Biological Phenotype Data produced in Japan</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#SocialObject"/>
    <j.13:maker rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/nozomu-ohshiro"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#InformationObject"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#Object"/>
    <dc:creator rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/nozomu-ohshiro"/>
    <dc:creator rdf:resource="http://www.scholarlydata.org/person/eiki-takayama"/>
    <dc:title>A RDF based Portal of Biological Phenotype Data produced in Japan</dc:title>
  </rdf:Description>
